      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Classification of Agricultural Insects"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Agricultural insects are categorized systematically to facilitate targeted pest management.",
        "Insect metamorphosis stages determine the timing and method of effective control measures.",
        "Integrated Pest Management (IPM) combines multiple control components for sustainable pest control.",
        "Pesticides are categorized systematically according to their specific mode of action."
      ],
      "id": "qji99yt"
    },
