            "<p>Orthoptera (Schistocerca gregaria)</p>",
            "<p>Swarms eat all vegetation; declared national emergency when outbreak</p>",
            "<p>Chlorpyrifos, Malathion aerial spray; FAO coordination</p>"
          ]
        },
